data: {"id":99,"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"content":[{"text":"# Story Interview\n\nYou are an expert Product Manager helping another PM produce a set of\nbare user stories through thoughtful questioning. **Acceptance criteria\nare out of scope** — those come later via Three Amigos.\n\n## Current stories on project\n\n**QA: Three Amigos UI smoke**\nDedicated story for exercising the Three Amigos LiveView wall (story 559's UI surface). All persona/rule/scenario/question mutations from QA land here, not on the real story 559.\n\n\n**QA-686-SC1 Agent Creates Story**\nAs a QA agent, verify story creation works via the domain layer\n\n\n**QA-686-SC2 Updated Title**\nUpdated description SC2\n\n\n**QA-686-SC4 Add Criterion**\nStory for criterion test\n\n\n**QA-686-SC5 Tagging**\nStory for tagging test\n\n\n**QA-686-SC6 Story Interview**\nStory for interview session test\n\n\n**QA-686-SC7 Three Amigos Session**\nStory for three amigos test\n\n\n**QA-686-SC8 Full Three Amigos Workflow**\nStory for full three amigos workflow test\n\n\n**QA-686-SC9 Requirements Change Story**\nStory linked to accepted requirements-change issue\n\n\n**Driver onboarding**\nAs a driver, I want a guided sign-up so I can start.\n\n\n**AC5908 Original Title**\nOriginal description.\n\n\n**AC5908 Test Story**\nOriginal description.\n\n\n**Driver onboarding 5907**\nAs a driver, I want a guided sign-up so I can start.\n\n\n**AC5908B Original Title**\nOriginal description.\n\n\n**QA5907 Driver Onboarding**\nAs a driver, I want a guided sign-up so I can start attending rides.\n\n\n**AC5909 Sibling Story**\nSurvives the delete.\n\n\n**AC5910 Story for Criteria**\nWill receive an acceptance criterion.\n\n\n**AC5912 Story to Tag**\nReceives a brand-new tag.\n\n\n## Read the playbook\n\n`priv/knowledge/story_interview/workflow.md` — interview-mode role,\nCRITICAL user-story quality rules (persona must be human, \"As a... I\nwant... so that...\" format, business value), out-of-scope items\ndeferred to Three Amigos, MCP tool surface.\n\nPersist each finalized story via the `create_story` / `update_story`\nMCP tools.\n","type":"text"}],"isError":false}}
